  {
    "hotel_id": "574515",
    "hotel_url": "https://www.agoda.com/gallery-prawirotaman-hotel/hotel/yogyakarta-id.html",
    "name": "Gallery Prawirotaman Hotel",
    "detail": "The staff are very friendly, and the breakfast is diverse and satisfying. Both Indonesian and Western dishes are good, but it was especially impressive to taste the traditional home-cooked meals and desserts from Central Java and Yogyakarta at the Javanese traditional food corner. The pool is clean and convenient to use. The rooms feel somewhat old but are well maintained and clean. The location, which allows easy walking access to various restaurants, cafes, and convenience stores on Prayirotam Street, is a great advantage. However, soundproofing is disappointing. You can hear conversations from the neighboring rooms, as well as the sound of switches turning on and off. Additionally, the call to prayer from a nearby mosque can be quite loud around 4:30 AM, waking you up. Overall, it is a satisfying stay, but due to the soundproofing issue, I am deducting one star. If you are not highly sensitive to noise, this hotel is worth recommending for its location, service, and value for money.",
